      "t": "Я действительно неплохо готовлю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I truly cook not badly.' With understatement, the master chef remarks that he actually cooks pretty well.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
